  {
   "id": "cat-girl-survivor-295771@1.21",
   "gameId": "cat-girl-survivor-295771",
   "displayName": "Update 1.21",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-04-02T06:32:10.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The adorable adventure of the Cat Girl Mages, \"Cat Girl Survivor\"!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Version 1.21 Update has been deployed!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It’s been a while, survivors! We are thrilled to announce a major addition to the game: the Boss Rush Mode!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🐾 What is Boss Rush Mode?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Test your limits by facing a relentless gauntlet of mid-bosses and bosses from the main story, one after another!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To help you survive the challenge, you’ll receive powerful rewards after clearing each round:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・3 Stat Growths",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・2 Equipment Drops",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・3 Skill Enhancements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Slot Machine Bonus Stats",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Boss Rush consists of 20 challenging floors. Do you have what it takes to reach the top?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We can't help but wonder... will you manage to clear this in the blink of an eye, just like before?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(The dev team is officially nervous! 😼)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please check our official X account for the update announcement as well!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please continue to enjoy the adventures of the cute Cat Girls! We look forward to receiving lots of support and feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4330630/\"][dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4038770\"] ©2025 Minimum Studio Corp. All rights reserved. Published by CFK.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
