     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The adorable adventure of the Cat Girl Mages, \"Cat Girl Survivor\"!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Version 1.14.3 Update has been deployed!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The update details are as follows",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "① Added a new Legendary Skill: \"Invisible Hand\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Invisible Hand: Reduces enemy movement speed by 90% for 1.8 seconds.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "② Added a new equipment item: \"Mysterious Turtle's Shoes\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "③ Added a bulk dismantle function for over 1,000 items (Excluding Advanced Equipment)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "④ Adjusted the difficulty level for each Chapter and Endless Mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⑤ Added a \"MAX\" display when EXP reaches maximum during gameplay",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In addition, we have implemented various quality-of-life improvements and optimization adjustments, including reduced frame drops and improved highlight display on the World Map.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please check our official X account for the update announcement as well!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please continue to enjoy the adventures of the cute Cat Girls! We look forward to receiving lots of support and feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "©2025 Minimum Studio Corp. All rights reserved. Published by CFK.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
